$ cat delivery-agreements.md deliveries/explicit/README.md deliveries/unclear/README.md deliveries/additional/README.md deliveries/empty-candidate/README.md
# Receiving agreements

- explicit: the entire agreement is one curated expression.h5ad plus README.md, containing S1 and S2. Native images and native output files were not requested.
- unclear: we received expression.h5ad and README.md, but no one has confirmed the intended delivery scope or supplied a source manifest. The README describes how to interpret objects, not a completeness agreement.
- additional: the agreement requires expression.h5ad containing specimens S1, S2 and S3, README.md, and cell_feature_matrix/matrix.mtx.gz with its barcodes.tsv.gz and features.tsv.gz. The H5AD is useful in addition to the required MEX, not a contractual substitute. The original source is unavailable for this check.
- empty-candidate: the agreement allows any readable expression-matrix representation with feature/cell correspondence plus README.md; a file named expression.h5ad was supplied as the candidate. We have no source manifest.
The H5AD candidate uses specimen plus cell barcode as its cell key; core marks the local coordinate frame. Coordinate units, when present, are core-local micrometers. X, when present, is documented as log1p-normalized expression and a scaled layer as centered standardized values. No biological-replicate relationship is specified. Native assay validation is outside this request.
